Boots of the Winding Path	TYPE:Wondrous Item.Boots.Attunement		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:UA2	SLOTS:2	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_UNCOMMON	SPROP:While wearing these boots, you can take a Bonus Action to teleport up to 15 feet to an unoccupied space you can see. You must have occupied that space at some point during the current turn.|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Boots of the Winding Path	DEFINE:Attunement_Boots_Of_The_Winding_Path|0	BONUS:VAR|Attunement_Boots_Of_The_Winding_Path|1	SPROP:Not attuned to Item|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Boots of the Winding Path

Helm of Awareness		TYPE:Wondrous Item.Headgear.Attunement		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:UA2	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_UNCOMMON	SPROP:While wearing this helmet, you have Advantage on Initiative rolls.|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Helm of Awareness	DEFINE:Attunement_Helm_of_Awareness|0	BONUS:VAR|Attunement_Helm_of_Awareness|1	SPROP:Not attuned to Item|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Helm of Awareness
Mind Sharpener			TYPE:Wondrous Item.Ring.Attunement		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:UA2	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_UNCOMMON.CHARGED_ITEM_4	SPROP:When you fail a Constitution saving throw to maintain Concentration, you can take a Reaction and expend 1 of the item’s charges to succeed instead. The item regains 1d4 expended charges daily at dawn.|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Mind Sharpener	DEFINE:Attunement_Mind_Sharpener|0	BONUS:VAR|Attunement_Mind_Sharpener|1	SPROP:Not attuned to Item|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Mind Sharpener
Repulsion Shield.MOD	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_UNCOMMON.PLUS1S	SPROP:While holding it, you can take a Reaction immediately after being hit by a melee attack roll to expend 1 of the shield’s charges and push the attacker up to 15 feet away. The shield regains 1d4 expended charges daily at dawn.|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Repulsion Shield	DEFINE:Attunement_Repulsion_Shield|0	BONUS:VAR|Attunement_Repulsion_Shield|1	SPROP:Not attuned to Item|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Repulsion Shield
Spell-Refueling Ring			TYPE:Wondrous Item.Ring.Attunement		WT:0	SOURCEPAGE:UA2	EQMOD:MAGIC_ITEM_UNCOMMON	SPROP:While wearing this ring, you can recover one expended spell slot as a Bonus Action. The recovered slot can be of level 3 or lower. Once used, the ring can’t be used again until the next dawn.|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Spell-Refueling Ring	DEFINE:Attunement_Spell_Refueling_Ring|0	BONUS:VAR|Attunement_Spell_Refueling_Ring|1	SPROP:Not attuned to Item|!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Attunement,Spell-Refueling Ring
